  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Application Scope**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on defining the application scope for \"Resume Architect.\" The focus is crystal clear: establishing the foundational elements. I\'m prioritizing project setup, design system, and key pages, with a tagline emphasizing proving job fit. My immediate priority involves establishing the project structure and folder arrangement.\n\n\n**Refining the Application Flow**\n\nI\'m now building out the initial app flow with React.js, Vite, Tailwind CSS, and React Router, focusing on a robust foundation. I\'ve set up routing for seamless transitions between landing, login, signup, and a preview dashboard, including state management for mock authentication. The current task is establishing project structure, with an eye toward integrating the Python FastAPI backend and Gemini AI API later. Also, I\'m focusing on the design system requirements for a professional SaaS feel.\n\n\n"
