  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Project Parameters**\n\nI\'ve carefully reviewed the user\'s request. My focus is now zeroed in on the project name \"Resume Architect\" and the tagline: \"Don\'t just match the job. Prove your fit.\" I\'m also examining the specific requirements, including project setup, a global design system, and the initial pages: landing, login, and signup. My immediate next step involves a deep dive into efficient project structures.\n\n\n**Defining Tech Stack & Design**\n\nI\'ve decided to prioritize the tech stack, settling on React.js with Vite, JavaScript/TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and React Router (installing react-router-dom). Lucide React icons are already included. I\'m focusing on clean, reusable React components and prepping for Python FastAPI backend and Gemini AI API integration with configs and typed API clients. For the design, I\'m leaning toward warm off-white, forest green, and charcoal tones, specifying exact hex codes for consistency and clean typography.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_730949"
