  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing UI Components**\n\nI\'m starting to build the common UI components. The first one is `Logo.tsx`. I envision the logo as a combination of a wordmark and an icon. The icon will be an architectural compass, drafting triangle, or structured \"A\", paired with crisp, clean typography for \"Resume Architect\".\n\n\n**Defining UI Elements**\n\nNow, I\'m focusing on defining core UI elements. The `Button` component will have various styles like primary, secondary, ghost, and outline, coupled with sizes (small, medium, large).  I\'ll ensure loading states are smooth with spinners.  Next, I\'m defining the `Input` component, aiming for a refined look with charcoal text and warm surface.  I\'m also outlining the navbar structure that will strictly adhere to a top bar contract.\n\n\n"
