    thinking: "**Analyzing Rejection Dynamics**\n\nI\'m now diving into the development of `ComparisonProof.tsx`, specifically focusing on the \"Match vs. Prove\" concept. My aim is to illustrate why the 90% rejection rate for applicants with high keyword matches persists in the initial recruiter screen. I intend to demonstrate how a proof-driven resume fundamentally alters this outcome. I\'m currently reviewing the necessary sections to structure this comparison effectively.\n\n\n"
