  planner_response {
    response: "The foundation of **Resume Architect** has been designed and implemented according to your design system and specifications.\n\n### What Was Built:\n\n1. **Project Setup & Folder Structure**:\n   * Organized modular architecture in `src/` featuring `components/common/`, `components/landing/`, `context/`, `pages/`, `services/`, and `types/`.\n   * Installed `react-router-dom` for client routing between `/` (Landing), `/login` (Login), `/signup` (Signup), and `/app` (Foundation Workspace Preview).\n   * Created `src/services/api.ts` and `src/services/authService.ts` pre-configured to communicate with a future Python FastAPI backend (`/api/v1`) with Bearer token injection and Gemini AI endpoints.\n\n2. **Global Design System**:\n   * **Color Palette**: Warm cream canvas (`#FAF8F5`), forest green primary accent (`#1B4332`, hover `#143627`, subtle tint `#EBF2EC`), charcoal body type (`#1C201D`, muted `#57605A`), and hairline sand borders (`#E5E1D7`).\n   * **Typography & Surfaces**: Plus Jakarta Sans paired with editorial accents, tabular figures for all metrics, rounded cards with subtle drop shadows (`shadow-card`), and zero neon or generic AI slop.\n   * **Component Suite**: Reusable `Button`, `Input`, `Logo` (architectural drafting mark), `Navbar` (strictly respecting the 3-zone Top Bar Contract), and `Footer`.\n\n3. **Landing Page (`/`)**:\n   * **Hero Section**: Features the core tagline *\"Don\'t just match the job. Prove your fit.\"* with a headline and clear CTA path.\n   * **Interactive Proof Sandbox**: A functional sandbox allowing visitors to toggle between different roles (Staff Architect, VP Product, Head of Growth) to compare generic AI keyword-stuffed bullets against Resume Architect\'s quantified evidence dockets. Includes an interactive inspection drawer for the 3 proof pillars.\n   * **The 3-Step Architect Protocol**: Editorial breakdown of Mandate Deconstruction (`01.`), Impact Excavation (`02.`), and Precision Dossier Generation (`03.`).\n   * **Match vs. Prove Matrix**: Analytical comparison demonstrating why keyword-stuffed resumes get discarded during the 6-second recruiter scan.\n   * **Proof & Case Studies**: Concrete quantitative figures (`3.4\303\227 Callback Rate`, `89% Conversion`, `+$42k Uplift`) and attributable testimonials.\n   * **Transparent Pricing**: Candidate Edition, Executive Fellowship, and Lifetime Architect tiers.\n   * **Closing CTA Banner**: Deep forest green conversion block with subtle drafting geometry.\n\n4. **Login Page (`/login`)**:\n   * Responsive split-panel layout pairing an executive philosophy sidebar with a clean authentication card.\n   * Email/password inputs, \"Remember me\", password reset affordance, and a convenient **Quick Demo Login** button for instant evaluation.\n\n5. **Signup Page (`/signup`)**:\n   * Structured onboarding capturing candidate Name, Email, Target Role, and Seniority Tier.\n   * Dynamic password strength meter, terms consent, and transition directly into the candidate workspace."
    modified_response: "The foundation of **Resume Architect** has been designed and implemented according to your design system and specifications.\n\n### What Was Built:\n\n1. **Project Setup & Folder Structure**:\n   * Organized modular architecture in `src/` featuring `components/common/`, `components/landing/`, `context/`, `pages/`, `services/`, and `types/`.\n   * Installed `react-router-dom` for client routing between `/` (Landing), `/login` (Login), `/signup` (Signup), and `/app` (Foundation Workspace Preview).\n   * Created `src/services/api.ts` and `src/services/authService.ts` pre-configured to communicate with a future Python FastAPI backend (`/api/v1`) with Bearer token injection and Gemini AI endpoints.\n\n2. **Global Design System**:\n   * **Color Palette**: Warm cream canvas (`#FAF8F5`), forest green primary accent (`#1B4332`, hover `#143627`, subtle tint `#EBF2EC`), charcoal body type (`#1C201D`, muted `#57605A`), and hairline sand borders (`#E5E1D7`).\n   * **Typography & Surfaces**: Plus Jakarta Sans paired with editorial accents, tabular figures for all metrics, rounded cards with subtle drop shadows (`shadow-card`), and zero neon or generic AI slop.\n   * **Component Suite**: Reusable `Button`, `Input`, `Logo` (architectural drafting mark), `Navbar` (strictly respecting the 3-zone Top Bar Contract), and `Footer`.\n\n3. **Landing Page (`/`)**:\n   * **Hero Section**: Features the core tagline *\"Don\'t just match the job. Prove your fit.\"* with a headline and clear CTA path.\n   * **Interactive Proof Sandbox**: A functional sandbox allowing visitors to toggle between different roles (Staff Architect, VP Product, Head of Growth) to compare generic AI keyword-stuffed bullets against Resume Architect\'s quantified evidence dockets. Includes an interactive inspection drawer for the 3 proof pillars.\n   * **The 3-Step Architect Protocol**: Editorial breakdown of Mandate Deconstruction (`01.`), Impact Excavation (`02.`), and Precision Dossier Generation (`03.`).\n   * **Match vs. Prove Matrix**: Analytical comparison demonstrating why keyword-stuffed resumes get discarded during the 6-second recruiter scan.\n   * **Proof & Case Studies**: Concrete quantitative figures (`3.4\303\227 Callback Rate`, `89% Conversion`, `+$42k Uplift`) and attributable testimonials.\n   * **Transparent Pricing**: Candidate Edition, Executive Fellowship, and Lifetime Architect tiers.\n   * **Closing CTA Banner**: Deep forest green conversion block with subtle drafting geometry.\n\n4. **Login Page (`/login`)**:\n   * Responsive split-panel layout pairing an executive philosophy sidebar with a clean authentication card.\n   * Email/password inputs, \"Remember me\", password reset affordance, and a convenient **Quick Demo Login** button for instant evaluation.\n\n5. **Signup Page (`/signup`)**:\n   * Structured onboarding capturing candidate Name, Email, Target Role, and Seniority Tier.\n   * Dynamic password strength meter, terms consent, and transition directly into the candidate workspace."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\252\002\n\247\002\001i\024}\023\034\t\r\206U\323V\027\027\272r\321\346Mi\355\377\032\360Zs\247\2045\362\020Uqi\313\321\301\262\342\227`B\005\326*\360hE{\032%\032L0l\340!\234\336Pg\254\331\001\335m\020\3246\347]\235=$+\251\324\354\340T\362w\002U\331Q1\004\035\212\023?r0g\341\005\330\"\202rC\200\023\036,\036\315[\361K\031\361\204>\214W\315?9\033mZ\373v5\265\001\237\222\270R}\240\257\n\3179\221\357\\$\v\313lb\264\261N)\025\021\311\023^\227\367\304\343\205\325\356aa7\234\205:\n\327!\311q\337\020\n\177\362A\351L\220\214\277~j\373\365kJ\202\302\370\\EC\247\350\'s!z\216#i*\021.\310\232\0248A\271G\f\220\347\323$\344n@\254)\033>\232\277`=\017\3448vw\261\213\261\322\277\225\274C\370nJ\271\214\373\230\272\263+*\331_\327\005\033\b\214fw\375d{\322\005\004?\376~~M\032i\313,\251\226\207_\205^;\252E:\307\247\t\0341]"
