  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Restructuring Landing Page**\n\nI\'ve determined that `PricingSection.tsx` is no longer needed and will be removed. The landing page is undergoing restructuring. The hero heading has been updated to: \"Build, Improve and Showcase.\"\n\n\n**Defining Product Scope**\n\nI\'ve scoped the product\'s value proposition, defining the description and tagline: \"Analyse your resume, measure your job compatibility, discover skill gaps and create a professional resume with AI assistance\" and \"Don\'t just match the job. Prove your fit.\" I\'ve outlined four key features: AI Resume Score Engine, Resume Builder, Resume Reviewer, and LinkedIn Optimizer. I have also decided to include a \"How It Works\" section, a footer, and a nav bar (without pricing). Finally, reusable score engine foundation components have been defined in `src/components/score-engine/`. The login page will contain an email field.\n\n\n"
