  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Score Engine Models**\n\nI\'m now diving into `src/types/index.ts`. My focus is refining the types to reflect the Score Engine\'s core domain models. I\'m incorporating detailed models that encompass `keywordAlignment`, `technicalSkillAlignment`, and `projectRelevance`. The goal is a clean, focused representation, removing any extraneous pricing-related types.\n\n\n**Refining Domain Model Types**\n\nI\'m now establishing a robust type system in `src/types/index.ts` to represent the core domain. I\'m focusing on clean, well-defined TypeScript interfaces. My goal is capturing key data models such as `User`, `AuthState`, `LoginCredentials`, and `SignupCredentials`. I\'m also specifying structures for `ScoreCategory`, `MissingKeyword`, `SkillGap`, `ImprovementRecommendation`, and `ResumeScoreResult`. I\'m now integrating types for `projectRelevance`, `experienceRelevance`, `educationRelevance`, and `formattingAndReadability`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_910032"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * Resume Architect Core Domain Types\\n * Clean, decoupled domain types prepared for FastAPI + SQLite + Gemini AI backend.\\n */\\n\\nexport interface User {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  avatarUrl?: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AuthState {\\n  user: User | null;\\n  isAuthenticated: boolean;\\n  isLoading: boolean;\\n  error: string | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LoginCredentials {\\n  email: string;\\n  password?: string;\\n  rememberMe?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SignupCredentials {\\n  name: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  password?: string;\\n  confirmPassword?: string;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * 6 Core Pillars of the Resume Architect Score Engine:\\n * 1. Job Description Keyword Alignment\\n * 2. Technical Skill Alignment\\n * 3. Project Relevance\\n * 4. Work Experience Relevance\\n * 5. Education Relevance\\n * 6. Resume Formatting & Readability\\n */\\nexport type ScoreCategoryId =\\n  | \'keyword-alignment\'\\n  | \'technical-skills\'\\n  | \'project-relevance\'\\n  | \'experience-relevance\'\\n  | \'education-relevance\'\\n  | \'formatting-readability\';\\n\\nexport interface ScoreCategory {\\n  id: ScoreCategoryId;\\n  name: string;\\n  score: number; // 0 - 100\\n  weight: number; // Decimal (e.g., 0.20)\\n  status: \'optimal\' | \'moderate\' | \'action-required\';\\n  summary: string;\\n  metrics: {\\n    matched: number;\\n    total: number;\\n    unit?: string;\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport interface MissingKeyword {\\n  id: string;\\n  term: string;\\n  category: \'Critical Mandate\' | \'Technical Tool\' | \'Industry Practice\' | \'Leadership\';\\n  jobFrequency: number;\\n  importance: \'critical\' | \'important\' | \'beneficial\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SkillGap {\\n  id: string;\\n  skillName: string;\\n  category: string;\\n  status: \'matched\' | \'partial\' | \'missing\';\\n  requiredContext: string;\\n  candidateEvidence: string | null;\\n  recommendation: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ImprovementRecommendation {\\n  id: string;\\n  category: ScoreCategoryId;\\n  title: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  priority: \'high\' | \'medium\' | \'low\';\\n  estimatedScoreDelta: number; // Estimated points gained if addressed\\n  sampleBefore?: string;\\n  sampleAfter?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ResumeScoreEvaluation {\\n  id: string;\\n  overallScore: number; // Calculated deterministically via weighted categories\\n  scoreGrade: \'Exceptional\' | \'Strong\' | \'Competitive\' | \'Needs Revision\';\\n  evaluatedAt: string;\\n  jobTitle: string;\\n  companyName?: string;\\n  resumeFileName: string;\\n  categories: ScoreCategory[];\\n  missingKeywords: MissingKeyword[];\\n  skillGaps: SkillGap[];\\n  recommendations: ImprovementRecommendation[];\\n  methodologyNotes: string;\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Define domain types for Auth and the 6-pillar Resume Score Engine\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/index.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing types/index.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update domain models for Score Engine\"}"
