  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Engine Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into building reusable score engine components in `src/components/score-engine/`, as specified. My focus is on creating the building blocks for: score display, a circular percentage indicator, category-wise score breakdown, a missing keyword list, and a skill gap visualizer. This structure ensures modularity and ease of maintenance.\n\n\n**Refining UI Components**\n\nI\'m now implementing the UI components for the score engine. The `CircularScoreIndicator` is taking shape with SVG animation and color coding. I\'m focusing on accessibility with ARIA attributes. I\'m also building `ScoreDisplay` with the circular indicator, job metadata, and methodology. `CategoryScoreBreakdown` is rendering the core pillars with progress bars and matched metrics. I\'m also developing `MissingKeywordList` to show high-priority missing keywords.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_946886"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\n\\ninterface CircularScoreIndicatorProps {\\n  score: number; // 0 to 100\\n  size?: number; // width & height in px, default 120\\n  strokeWidth?: number; // stroke width in px, default 10\\n  showLabel?: boolean;\\n  className?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport const CircularScoreIndicator: React.FC<CircularScoreIndicatorProps> = ({\\n  score,\\n  size = 120,\\n  strokeWidth = 10,\\n  showLabel = true,\\n  className = \'\',\\n}) => {\\n  // Clamp score between 0 and 100\\n  const normalizedScore = Math.min(100, Math.max(0, score));\\n\\n  const center = size / 2;\\n  const radius = center - strokeWidth;\\n  const circumference = 2 * Math.PI * radius;\\n  const strokeDashoffset = circumference - (normalizedScore / 100) * circumference;\\n\\n  // Determine stroke color based on score grade (using forest green as primary)\\n  const getStrokeColor = (s: number) => {\\n    if (s >= 85) return \'#1B4332\'; // Forest Green\\n    if (s >= 75) return \'#2D6A4F\'; // Medium Forest / Sage\\n    if (s >= 60) return \'#B07D38\'; // Muted Warm Amber\\n    return \'#A34848\'; // Muted Red\\n  };\\n\\n  const strokeColor = getStrokeColor(normalizedScore);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      className={`relative inline-flex items-center justify-center select-none ${className}`}\\n      style={{ width: size, height: size }}\\n      role=\\\"progressbar\\\"\\n      aria-valuenow={normalizedScore}\\n      aria-valuemin={0}\\n      aria-valuemax={100}\\n      aria-label={`Resume Compatibility Score: ${normalizedScore} out of 100`}\\n    >\\n      <svg width={size} height={size} className=\\\"transform -rotate-90\\\">\\n        {/* Background track circle */}\\n        <circle\\n          cx={center}\\n          cy={center}\\n          r={radius}\\n          fill=\\\"transparent\\\"\\n          stroke=\\\"#E5E1D7\\\"\\n          strokeWidth={strokeWidth}\\n        />\\n        {/* Animated progress circle */}\\n        <circle\\n          cx={center}\\n          cy={center}\\n          r={radius}\\n          fill=\\\"transparent\\\"\\n          stroke={strokeColor}\\n          strokeWidth={strokeWidth}\\n          strokeDasharray={circumference}\\n          strokeDashoffset={strokeDashoffset}\\n          strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n          className=\\\"transition-all duration-700 ease-out\\\"\\n        />\\n      </svg>\\n\\n      {/* Center content */}\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center\\\">\\n        <span\\n          className=\\\"font-bold tracking-tight text-[#1C201D] font-mono tabular-nums leading-none\\\"\\n          style={{ fontSize: `${size * 0.28}px` }}\\n        >\\n          {normalizedScore}\\n        </span>\\n        {showLabel && (\\n          <span\\n            className=\\\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-[#848E88] mt-1\\\"\\n            style={{ fontSize: `${Math.max(10, size * 0.09)}px` }}\\n          >\\n            / 100 Match\\n          </span>\\n        )}\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create reusable CircularScoreIndicator component with SVG animation and score color tokens\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/score-engine/CircularScoreIndicator.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing CircularScoreIndicator.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create circular percentage score component\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\367\021\n\364\021\001i\024}\023\234A\250\375\263\272\222\263\305\242\367-\3348I\333\n`Q\355c\215\275\024\341\272}\262a\337_\224\317\271\353\211\360\263\370t\033\243\006(\315\210\343\216\004\327\300\254\222\262\305r\232b\332&G\350\376\257\365\327\307\2369\232\333\034(\310W\330%-\244\3173\370]U\272$\026\v\362-\201#\366\352z\304H\236\254\025\326\207\245`\371PR[\270\362\236F3\216JN\332v\221\203\222\321\255\026=s\321\343;\212~\276\344\251\206a]\350\244\367t\333\310\237f\335\255\031R\235\300b\002\246\270\250\304M\250\332\222z\fz\323\270\252\360j\271a\207q\262`\2117\214\220\023\032\263\273\366\241\302\364o\303\347z\233\246\312\213\350\317Y\3245;(\232\030u(\372r\026\330\314I/\310\231\033i\223\035\020<8\246\375\244\375\37443\212\177^\316\346\006l\306%\023M\"U\202v\0054\032n\320!\025\227h\330\247\000\ve\206z\004w*xI\236k\335\313\237Y>\324~\365\260\375\220z\364\203\250\331\022\021\307\204\320G\234\240\323\325\373\353\3042\207\272\233\000\370\230w\370\275\224\\\310%r(3\022\n\314V\2207s\206\v\251*A\237\3120\234|b\333\2474\321%\366\320\264!\211\274\340!\325\351Q\362\325\030:\214\304\205\343\261\225\234\"\226\\Ll\363\266\224\240\nS\036\357y]\340I\032q\313\206\251\037\035r\276\177\371\036\226\026\351\241\335&\232S\2179+\257$\003\332\324=\322B\247\253\241L\205\253u\361&\313\223\243Y66%\332\346\025X+<A\002T\224\300aj\233\356\353\351\243\351\206V\213\274\242v\206b\373\320?\334-|\266]\232Z\001\333\033\226\005\273<2o\351%\370*\247\005\377k\222n\020\033|\375\237\3457\207\307\205\211\311Ztg\325\230c3H\f7\001\373KA\277\207\017\263\a\314\304\310L^\017\372\275sWK\351\2154\001^\201\371\037\n\345\325\212}\020A\246[\347!g\225\340\356go`\306\350dA\026\311%f\350\227\326\3549\375\273\330V\337\200\366\271\335\\\306o\237&\372\204O\216\2206\221\325\\\210m\330).)\340\356%\207\247\275\362\215\300\232\200\270\a\\\341\356d\242\257X\017\311?\301\257\n\3122\367\005\217_\342\236\272\227%\233\37486\364\241\t\304_\212\332/Ue\320u\336\3539\242{\243\177>\026\277\223\351\364\324\3