  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Landing Page**\n\nI\'m now focused on the specific components for the landing page. My current task is to implement the \"Resume Architect\" logo, navigation bar, hero section, and features, as outlined. These elements will form the core of the landing page structure.\n\n\n**Defining Landing Page Sections**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on defining the remaining landing page sections. I have decided on the \"How It Works\" section, followed by the footer. The hero section is now fleshed out, including the exact heading and description. It will prominently feature the tagline. I have the four features in mind that need to be updated: AI Resume Score Engine, Resume Builder, Resume Reviewer and LinkedIn Optimizer. I will implement these as an important section.\n\n\n**Implementing Feature Spotlight**\n\nI\'m now making strides on the feature spotlights. I\'ve pinpointed the primary and secondary CTAs for the landing page. \"Get Started Free\" will be a `/signup` link. I\'m also now focusing on the \"How It Works\" and Score Engine sections, aiming for a streamlined, step-by-step user journey. I\'m keen to implement an interactive preview, making the Score Engine immediately engaging for the user. I plan to use the four features I already fleshed out: AI Resume Score Engine, Resume Builder, Resume Reviewer and LinkedIn Optimizer. I will implement these as an important section.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_767296"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { Link } from \'react-router-dom\';\\nimport { Button } from \'../common/Button\';\\nimport { ArrowRight, ShieldCheck, CheckCircle2, Gauge, Sparkles } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface HeroProps {\\n  onExploreScoreEngine: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Hero: React.FC<HeroProps> = ({ onExploreScoreEngine }) => {\\n  return (\\n    <section className=\\\"relative pt-12 pb-16 md:pt-20 md:pb-24 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6\\\">\\n          {/* Tagline kicker */}\\n          <div className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#EBF2EC] text-[#1B4332] text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase\\\">\\n            <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#1B4332]\\\" />\\n            <span>Don\'t just match the job. Prove your fit.</span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Specified Marquee Headline */}\\n          <h1 className=\\\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#1C201D] leading-[1.14] [text-wrap:balance]\\\">\\n            Build, Improve and Showcase a Resume That{\' \'}\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[#1B4332] underline decoration-[#1B4332]/30 underline-offset-8\\\">\\n              Gets You Hired.\\n            </span>\\n          </h1>\\n\\n          {/* Specified Value Proposition Description */}\\n          <p className=\\\"text-base sm:text-lg text-[#57605A] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto [text-wrap:balance]\\\">\\n            Analyse your resume, measure your job compatibility, discover skill gaps and create a\\n            professional resume with AI assistance.\\n          </p>\\n\\n          {/* CTA Group */}\\n          <div className=\\\"pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3\\\">\\n            <Link to=\\\"/signup\\\" className=\\\"w-full sm:w-auto\\\">\\n              <Button\\n                size=\\\"lg\\\"\\n                variant=\\\"primary\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full sm:w-auto text-base\\\"\\n                rightIcon={<ArrowRight className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />}\\n              >\\n                Create Account Free\\n              </Button>\\n            </Link>\\n            <Button\\n              size=\\\"lg\\\"\\n              variant=\\\"secondary\\\"\\n              className=\\\"w-full sm:w-auto text-base\\\"\\n              onClick={onExploreScoreEngine}\\n              leftIcon={<Gauge className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-[#1B4332]\\\" />}\\n            >\\n              Explore AI Score Engine\\n            </Button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Clean unboxed proof points */}\\n          <div className=\\\"pt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs text-[#57605A]\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium text-[#1C201D]\\\">\\n              <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#1B4332]\\\" />\\n              Transparent Match Scoring\\n            </span>\\n            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" className=\\\"text-[#D6D1C4]\\\">\302\267</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium text-[#1C201D]\\\">\\n              <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#1B4332]\\\" />\\n              ATS-Conscious Architecture\\n            </span>\\n            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" className=\\\"text-[#D6D1C4]\\\">\302\267</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium text-[#1C201D]\\\">\\n              <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#1B4332]\\\" />\\n              No Paywalls or Hidden Tiers\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update Hero component with specified heading, description, and tagline\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/landing/Hero.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing components/landing/Hero.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update Hero section with exact copy\"}"
