  planner_response {
    response: "The foundation of **RESUME ARCHITECT** has been updated and built strictly following your product direction and architectural requirements.\n\n---\n\n### 1. Product Direction & No-Paywall Alignment\n* **AI Resume Score Engine Priority**: The AI Resume Score Engine is positioned as the primary centerpiece of the platform.\n* **Zero Paywall / No Pricing**: All pricing pages, subscription plans, payment gateways, and membership barriers have been completely removed. All core features are designed to be freely accessible.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Global Design System\n* **Warm off-white background**: `#FAF8F5` canvas with `#FCFBF8` / `#FFFFFF` card surfaces.\n* **Forest green accents**: Deep forest green (`#1B4332`, hover `#143627`, subtle tints `#EBF2EC`, `#2D6A4F`).\n* **Charcoal typography**: Primary text (`#1C201D`), secondary/muted (`#57605A`), subtle (`#848E88`).\n* **Clean professional cards**: Subtle hairline borders (`#E5E1D7`), rounded corners (`rounded-2xl`), and gentle shadows (`shadow-card`, `shadow-subtle`).\n* **Minimal animations**: Clean CSS transitions (150\342\200\223200ms) with zero neon colors, excessive gradients, or futuristic AI clich\303\251s.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Built Components\n\n#### A. Landing Page (`/`)\n* **Logo**: Custom geometric drafting mark and crisp *\"Resume Architect\"* wordmark.\n* **Navigation Bar**: 3-zone header with direct navigation to **Features**, **AI Score Engine**, **How It Works**, and **Sign In / Get Started Free** (no pricing links).\n* **Hero Section**:\n  * **Heading**: *\"Build, Improve and Showcase a Resume That Gets You Hired.\"*\n  * **Description**: *\"Analyse your resume, measure your job compatibility, discover skill gaps and create a professional resume with AI assistance.\"*\n  * **Tagline**: *\"Don\'t just match the job. Prove your fit.\"*\n* **Features Section** (The 4 core capabilities):\n  1. **AI Resume Score Engine**: Analyze resumes against job descriptions and calculate a transparent match score.\n  2. **Resume Builder**: Create ATS-conscious resumes using candidate information.\n  3. **Resume Reviewer**: Identify skill gaps, missing keywords and formatting issues.\n  4. **LinkedIn Optimizer**: Improve LinkedIn headlines, About sections, experience and skills.\n* **AI Score Engine Spotlight**: Live interactive inspection showcasing the deterministic 6-pillar score calculation, missing keyword discovery, skill gap breakdown, and targeted improvement recommendations.\n* **How It Works Section**: 4-step workflow (Submit Resume & Mandate $\\rightarrow$ Transparent 6-Pillar Evaluation $\\rightarrow$ Inspect Gaps $\\rightarrow$ Optimize & Export).\n* **Footer**: Quiet footer detailing core capabilities, scoring methodology, and access links without payment gates.\n\n#### B. Login Page (`/login`)\n* **Email & Password Fields**: Validated with clear feedback.\n* **Show/Hide Password**: Dedicated toggle button with `Eye` / `EyeOff` icons.\n* **Remember Me**: Checkbox for session retention.\n* **Forgot Password**: Interactive modal with email recovery flow.\n* **Login & Signup Navigation**: Instant switching to `/signup`.\n* **Quick Demo Login**: Convenient one-click sign-in to immediately test candidate flows during evaluation.\n\n#### C. Signup Page (`/signup`)\n* **Fields**: Full Name, Email, Password, and Confirm Password.\n* **Show/Hide Password Toggles**: Accessible on both password fields.\n* **Frontend Validation**: Enforces valid email formats, minimum 8 characters for passwords, and matching confirmation passwords.\n* **Navigation**: Seamless link to `/login`.\n\n#### D. Authentication Foundation\n* **Decoupled Architecture**: Located at `src/services/authService.ts` and `src/context/AuthContext.tsx`.\n* **Development Notice**: Explicit disclaimers in code and UI clarify that local storage authentication is temporary for development and not presented as production-secure.\n* **Backend Readiness**: Prepared with typed endpoints to swap to Python FastAPI (`POST /api/v1/auth/login`, `POST /api/v1/auth/register`) with SQLite database persistence.\n\n#### E. Score Engine Foundation (6 Reusable Components)\nIn `src/components/score-engine/`, designed for transparent, deterministic evaluation:\n1. `CircularScoreIndicator.tsx`: Circular SVG percentage indicator with stroke dashoffset and score grade tokens.\n2. `ScoreDisplay.tsx`: Master score card combining circular score, score grade, job title, and methodology details.\n3. `CategoryScoreBreakdown.tsx`: Visual breakdown of the **6 pillars**:\n   * *Job Description Keyword Alignment* (25% weight)\n   * *Technical Skill Alignment* (25% weight)\n   * *Work Experience Relevance* (20% weight)\n   * *Project Relevance* (15% weight)\n   * *Resume Formatting and Readability* (10% weight)\n   * *Education Relevance* (5% weight)\n4. `MissingKeywordList.tsx`: High-frequency missing job terms classified by importance (*Critical Mandate*, *Technical Tool*, *Industry Practice*).\n5. `SkillGapAnalysis.tsx`: Compares required job context against detected candidate evidence.\n6. `ImprovementRecommendations.tsx`: Actionable recommendations with estimated point gains and before/after bullet rewrites.\n* **Scoring Integrity**: Does not use random numbers or hallucinated percentages. Computes overall score deterministically: $\\sum (\\text{Category Score} \\times \\text{Weight})$.\n\n---\n\n### 4. File Structure Created\n\n```\nsrc/\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 components/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 common/             # Button, Input, Logo, Navbar, Footer\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 landing/            # Hero, FeaturesSection, ScoreEngineSpotlight, HowItWorksSection, CtaSection\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 score-engine/       # CircularScoreIndicator, ScoreDisplay, CategoryScoreBreakdown,\n\342\224\202                           # MissingKeywordList, SkillGapAnalysis, ImprovementRecommendations\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 context/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 AuthContext.tsx     # Session management & auth hooks\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 layouts/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 MainLayout.tsx      # Standard application layout\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 AuthLayout.tsx      # Split-screen authentication layout\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 pages/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 LandingPage.tsx     # Public landing page\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 LoginPage.tsx       # Login page with show/hide password and forgot modal\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 SignupPage.tsx      # Registration page with validation\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 AppPreviewPage.tsx  # Score Engine foundation workspace\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 services/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 api.ts              # Fetch client ready for FastAPI base URL (/api/v1)\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 authService.ts      # Temporary dev auth service\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 scoreEngineService.ts # Score Engine API service\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 types/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.ts            # Core TypeScript domain models\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 utils/\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 scoreCalculation.ts # Transparent 6-pillar formula & canonical benchmark data\n    \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 validation.ts       # Form validation utilities\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. How to Run & Test the Application\n\n1. **Development Server**: The Vite dev server is running on `http://localhost:3000` (and accessible via your Development App URL).\n2. **Landing Page**: Visit `/` to review the hero, the four highlighted features, the live AI Score Engine spotlight, and the workflow.\n3. **Sign In**: Navigate to `/login`. You can either enter credentials or click **Quick Demo Login** to enter the workspace. Test the password visibility toggle (`Eye` icon) and the **Forgot password?** modal.\n4. **Sign Up**: Navigate to `/signup`. Try typing mismatched passwords to observe frontend validation, then register to enter the workspace.\n5. **Score Engine Workspace**: Visit `/app` (after login) to inspect the 6-pillar category breakdown, missing keyword lists, skill gaps, and backend roadmap for FastAPI, SQLite, Gemini AI, and PDF/DOCX processing."
