    user_response: "Continue developing the existing Resume Architect project.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nDo not create a new project or redesign the existing landing page, login or signup pages.\n\nInspect the existing code and maintain the same design system.\n\nFor this phase, build ONLY the authenticated Tools Dashboard and Resume History interface.\n\n==================================================\n\n1. DESIGN REQUIREMENTS\n   ==================================================\n\nFollow the finalised Resume Architect UI reference.\n\nDesign:\n\n* Warm off-white background.\n* Forest green primary accents.\n* Charcoal text.\n* Clean white cards.\n* Subtle borders and shadows.\n* Professional typography.\n* Consistent spacing.\n* Responsive layout.\n\nAvoid:\n\n* Excessive gradients.\n* Neon colours.\n* Unnecessary animations.\n* Pricing or subscription sections.\n* Overcrowded dashboards.\n\n==================================================\n2. DASHBOARD LAYOUT\n===================\n\nCreate a professional dashboard with a left sidebar and main content area.\n\nLEFT SIDEBAR:\n\nInclude:\n\n1. Home\n2. Create Resume\n3. Review Resume\n4. Resume Editor\n5. LinkedIn Optimizer\n6. My Resumes\n7. Profile\n8. Settings\n9. Logout\n\nUse L"
