  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Dashboard Header**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the `/src/components/dashboard/DashboardHeader.tsx` file. Currently, I\'m ensuring it adheres to the Top Bar Contract. On the left side, I\'m working on breadcrumbs and the context title, such as \"Resume Architect / Home\" or \"Resume Architect / My Resumes (Resume History)\". I\'m also including the mobile menu hamburger toggle. Finally, I\'m considering the quick primary CTA for the right side of the header.\n\n\n"
