  view_file {
    absolute_path_uri: "file:///PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md"
    end_line: 105
    content: "# RESUME ARCHITECT \342\200\224 Project Foundation & Architecture\n\n**Tagline**: *Don\'t just match the job. Prove your fit.*\n\nResume Architect is an AI-powered resume analysis, scoring and improvement platform. All core resume-building, reviewing, editing, and LinkedIn optimization features are accessible without payment-related restrictions.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Directory Structure\n\n```\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 .env.example                       # Environment variables (GEMINI_API_KEY, VITE_API_URL)\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.html                         # Entry HTML with typography & metadata\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 metadata.json                      # Applet descriptor\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json                       # Dependencies (React 19, Vite, Tailwind v4, React Router)\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md               # Project documentation\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 App.tsx                        # Root Router configuration\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.css                      # Global design system tokens & shadows\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 main.tsx                       # React application entrypoint\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 components/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 common/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Button.tsx             # Reusable design system button\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Input.tsx              # Reusable input with validation & icon support\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Logo.tsx               # Brand mark & wordmark\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Navbar.tsx             # 3-Zone top navigation (no pricing)\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 Footer.tsx             # Quiet footer with 4 core capabilities\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 landing/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Hero.tsx               # Specified hero heading & value proposition\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 FeaturesSection.tsx    # 4 Core features (Score Engine, Builder, Reviewer, LinkedIn)\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ScoreEngineSpotlight.tsx # Central spotlight showcasing Score Engine\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 HowItWorksSection.tsx  # 4-step workflow overview\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 CtaSection.tsx         # Conversion banner (free access, no paywalls)\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 score-engine/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 CircularScoreIndicator.tsx # Circular percentage indicator\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ScoreDisplay.tsx           # Master compatibility score card\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 CategoryScoreBreakdown.tsx # 6-Pillar category breakdown\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 MissingKeywordList.tsx     # Absent job keywords by importance\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 SkillGapAnalysis.tsx       # Mandate vs. candidate evidence analysis\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 ImprovementRecommendations.tsx # Prioritized rewrites with score deltas\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 context/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 AuthContext.tsx            # Local dev auth state & hooks\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 layouts/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 MainLayout.tsx             # General application layout\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 AuthLayout.tsx             # Centered authentication layout\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 pages/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 LandingPage.tsx            # Marketing & platform overview\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 LoginPage.tsx              # Email, password, show/hide, remember me, forgot modal\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 SignupPage.tsx             # Full name, email, password, confirm password, validation\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 AppPreviewPage.tsx         # Score Engine foundation workspace\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 services/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 api.ts                     # Fetch client configured for FastAPI baseURL\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 authService.ts             # Temporary dev auth service with backend hooks\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 scoreEngineService.ts      # Score engine service prepared for /api/v1/score-engine\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 types/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.ts                   # Core domain models (ScoreCategory, SkillGap, etc.)\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 utils/\n\342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 scoreCalculation.ts        # Transparent 6-pillar scoring formula & benchmark\n\342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 validation.ts              # Form validation helpers\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Design System Tokens\n\n* **Canvas Background**: Warm off-white / cream (`#FAF8F5`, `#FCFBF8`, `#F3EFE7`)\n* **Surfaces**: Crisp white (`#FFFFFF`) and warm surface (`#FAF8F5`)\n* **Primary Accent**: Forest Green (`#1B4332`, hover `#143627`, tints `#EBF2EC`, `#2D6A4F`)\n* **Charcoal Text**: Primary (`#1C201D`), Muted (`#57605A`), Subtle (`#848E88`)\n* **Subtle Borders**: `#E5E1D7` (light grey / sand hairline)\n* **Shadows**: Subtle, crisp card shadows (`shadow-card`, `shadow-subtle`)\n* **Typography**: Plus Jakarta Sans for clean readability, monospace tabular figures for scores.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Four Core Capabilities\n\n1. **AI Resume Score Engine**: Analyse resumes against job descriptions and calculate a transparent match score.\n2. **Resume Builder**: Create ATS-conscious resumes using candidate information.\n3. **Resume Reviewer**: Identify skill gaps, missing keywords and formatting issues.\n4. **LinkedIn Optimizer**: Improve LinkedIn headlines, About sections, experience and skills.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Score Engine Architecture (6 Evaluation Pillars)\n\nThe future scoring engine deterministically calculates overall match scores using transparent weighted categories (no hallucinated random numbers):\n\n1. **Job Description Keyword Alignment (25%)**\n2. **Technical Skill Alignment (25%)**\n3. **Work Experience Relevance (20%)**\n4. **Project Relevance (15%)**\n5. **Resume Formatting & Readability (10%)**\n6. **Education Relevance (5%)**\n\n$$\\text{Overall Score} = \\sum (\\text{Category Score} \\times \\text{Weight})$$\n\n---\n\n## 5. Backend & AI Readiness\n\n* **FastAPI Backend**: `src/services/api.ts` connects to `VITE_API_URL` (defaults to `/api/v1`) with automatic Bearer token handling.\n* **SQLite Database**: Models in `src/types/index.ts` map directly to SQLite tables for users, resumes, job descriptions, and scoring evaluations.\n* **Gemini AI API**: Prepared for prompt pipelines to extract keywords and rewrite bullets without inventing final score numbers.\n* **PDF & DOCX Processing**: Architectural hooks ready for multipart file uploads and ATS semantic text extraction.\n"
    num_lines: 106
    num_bytes: 6053
    line_range_bytes: 6053
  }
}
