  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining AI Studio Components**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the components for the AI Resume Studio, aiming for a clean, modular, and maintainable structure. I\'ve started outlining the essential components, such as `PersonalInfoSection.tsx`, which will handle key details like full name, contact information, and relevant URLs.\n\n\n**Outlining Feature Details**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics of several studio components. I\'m fleshing out `CareerObjectiveSection.tsx`, including the Gemini AI integration for content generation, and defining the structure for the `EducationSection.tsx` and `SkillsSection.tsx` components. The skills section will also integrate AI for keyword recommendations. I\'m also planning the `ProjectsSection.tsx`, with AI-powered refinement for contributions.\n\n\n**Detailing Experience & Preview**\n\nI\'m currently working on `ExperienceSection.tsx`, focusing on multiple entries with fields for organization, job title, and dates, with a \"Rewrite Bullets\" feature. I\'m also designing the `ResumeDocumentPreview.tsx`, planning a clean, ATS-friendly single-column layout with sections for summary, skills, experience, projects, and education. It will include print, PDF, and DOCX export options.\n\nI\'ve also begun sketching out the \"Improve Existing Resume\" tab, which will integrate with the forthcoming Resume Reviewer.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_906792"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { ResumeStudioData } from \'../types\';\\n\\nexport const INITIAL_EMPTY_STUDIO_DATA: ResumeStudioData = {\\n  personalInfo: {\\n    fullName: \'\',\\n    email: \'\',\\n    phone: \'\',\\n    location: \'\',\\n    linkedinUrl: \'\',\\n    githubUrl: \'\',\\n    portfolioUrl: \'\',\\n  },\\n  careerObjective: {\\n    targetJobRole: \'\',\\n    targetIndustry: \'\',\\n    professionalSummary: \'\',\\n  },\\n  education: [\\n    {\\n      id: \'edu_1\',\\n      institutionName: \'\',\\n      degree: \'\',\\n      branch: \'\',\\n      startYear: \'\',\\n      graduationYear: \'\',\\n      cgpaOrPercentage: \'\',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n  skills: {\\n    programmingLanguages: [],\\n    frameworks: [],\\n    databases: [],\\n    developerTools: [],\\n    coreSubjects: [],\\n    otherSkills: [],\\n  },\\n  projects: [\\n    {\\n      id: \'proj_1\',\\n      projectName: \'\',\\n      projectDescription: \'\',\\n      technologiesUsed: \'\',\\n      projectLink: \'\',\\n      keyContributions: \'\',\\n      projectOutcome: \'\',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n  experience: [\\n    {\\n      id: \'exp_1\',\\n      organisation: \'\',\\n      jobTitle: \'\',\\n      startDate: \'\',\\n      endDate: \'\',\\n      isCurrent: false,\\n      responsibilities: \'\',\\n      keyAchievements: \'\',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n};\\n\\nexport const SAMPLE_CANDIDATE_DATA: ResumeStudioData = {\\n  personalInfo: {\\n    fullName: \'Sarah Lindqvist\',\\n    email: \'sarah.lindqvist@eng.io\',\\n    phone: \'+1 (555) 234-5678\',\\n    location: \'San Francisco, CA\',\\n    linkedinUrl: \'linkedin.com/in/sarah-lindqvist\',\\n    githubUrl: \'github.com/slindqvist\',\\n    portfolioUrl: \'sarahlindqvist.dev\',\\n  },\\n  careerObjective: {\\n    targetJobRole: \'Senior Cloud Systems Architect\',\\n    targetIndustry: \'Enterprise Distributed Systems & Cloud Platforms\',\\n    professionalSummary:\\n      \'Senior Systems Architect with 6+ years designing high-throughput, fault-tolerant distributed infrastructure on AWS and Kubernetes. Demonstrated track record decoupling legacy microservices, slashing p99 latency by 45%, and maintaining 99.999% SLA uptime for multi-tenant enterprise platforms.\',\\n  },\\n  education: [\\n    {\\n      id: \'edu_1\',\\n      institutionName: \'University of California, Berkeley\',\\n      degree: \'Bachelor of Science (B.S.)\',\\n      branch: \'Computer Science & Engineering\',\\n      startYear: \'2016\',\\n      graduationYear: \'2020\',\\n      cgpaOrPercentage: \'3.86 / 4.00\',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n  skills: {\\n    programmingLanguages: [\'Go\', \'TypeScript\', \'Python\', \'Rust\', \'SQL\'],\\n    frameworks: [\'Node.js\', \'Express\', \'React\', \'gRPC\', \'Protobuf\'],\\n    databases: [\'PostgreSQL\', \'Redis\', \'Kafka\', \'DynamoDB\'],\\n    developerTools: [\'Kubernetes (EKS)\', \'Docker\', \'Terraform\', \'Prometheus\', \'Git\'],\\n    coreSubjects: [\'Distributed Systems\', \'Computer Networks\', \'Operating Systems\', \'Database Internals\'],\\n    otherSkills: [\'Zero-Downtime Migration\', \'Chaos Engineering\', \'API Design\', \'System Architecture\'],\\n  },\\n  projects: [\\n    {\\n      id: \'proj_1\',\\n      projectName: \'High-Concurrency Event Ledger\',\\n      projectDescription:\\n        \'Engineered an append-only transaction ledger capable of processing 25,000 requests/sec with strict serializability guarantees.\',\\n      technologiesUsed: \'Go, Kafka, Redis, PostgreSQL, Docker\',\\n      projectLink: \'github.com/slindqvist/event-ledger\',\\n      keyContributions:\\n        \'Implemented Raft consensus log compaction and pipeline buffering, reducing memory consumption by 34% under peak burst loads.\',\\n      projectOutcome: \'Adopted as the foundational reference architecture for real-time payment settlement pipeline.\',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n  experience: [\\n    {\\n      id: \'exp_1\',\\n      organisation: \'Stratos Cloud Systems\',\\n      jobTitle: \'Senior Infrastructure Engineer\',\\n      startDate: \'2022-04\',\\n      endDate: \'Present\',\\n      isCurrent: true,\\n      responsibilities:\\n        \'Orchestrated multi-region Kubernetes cluster federation across 3 cloud regions.\\\\nDesigned automated canary rollout pipelines with Prometheus metric threshold validation.\\\\nMentored 6 software engineers on distributed tracing and eBPF network profiling.\',\\n      keyAchievements:\\n        \'Reduced p99 API latency from 142ms to 12ms and sustained zero unplanned downtime during Black Friday 2024 peak traffic.\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'exp_2\',\\n      organisation: \'Apex Payment Gateway\',\\n      jobTitle: \'Software Engineer II (Backend)\',\\n      startDate: \'2020-07\',\\n      endDate: \'2022-03\',\\n      isCurrent: false,\\n      responsibilities:\\n        \'Engineered core transaction routing microservices handling 4.2M daily API invocations.\\\\nRefactored monolithic PostgreSQL stored procedures into idiomatic Go microservices with database connection pooling.\',\\n      keyAchievements:\\n        \'Achieved 99.99% transaction reliability and lowered database CPU utilization by 40% through Redis caching.\',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create sample candidate data for AI Resume Studio testing and demonstration\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/utils/sampleResumeData.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing utils/sampleResumeData.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create sample candidate profile data\"}"
