  planner_response {
    response: "The **AI Resume Studio** workspace has been built within the authenticated Resume Architect platform. It adheres to the forest-green and warm off-white design system, reuses the existing sidebar, header, and UI components, and connects to Gemini AI API endpoints with strict zero-hallucination constraints.\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built:\n\n#### 1. Page Header & Dual-Tab Layout (`src/components/studio/ResumeStudioView.tsx`)\n* **Title**: **\"AI Resume Studio\"**\n* **Subtitle**: *\"Build a professional resume that demonstrates your skills and matches your career goals.\"*\n* **Top Navigation Tabs**:\n  1. **Create from Scratch**: The primary creation workspace (fully implemented in this phase).\n  2. **Improve Existing Resume**: Prepared for the upcoming Resume Reviewer integration, allowing candidates to pick any resume from their history and load it into the Studio or run compatibility analysis.\n* **Quick Tools Toolbar**:\n  * **Load Sample Profile**: Instant 1-click loading of a complete senior engineering candidate profile (`Sarah Lindqvist`) to test all sections, AI features, and live rendering without manual entry.\n  * **Clear Form**: Resets all fields to blank.\n  * **Mobile Editor / Preview Toggle**: Allows mobile and tablet users to toggle between form entry and the live ATS document sheet.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. User Information Form (Sections A through F)\n\n* **Section A: Personal Information (`src/components/studio/PersonalInfoSection.tsx`)**:\n  * Full Name, Email, Phone Number, Location.\n  * LinkedIn URL, GitHub URL, and Portfolio / Personal Website URL.\n\n* **Section B: Career Objective & Summary (`src/components/studio/CareerObjectiveSection.tsx`)**:\n  * Target Job Role & Target Industry / Domain.\n  * Professional Summary textarea.\n  * **Gemini AI Integration**: *\"Generate with Gemini AI\"* button synthesizes a concise, 3-sentence professional summary using **strictly** the user\'s supplied background, skills, and target role without inventing metrics.\n\n* **Section C: Education (`src/components/studio/EducationSection.tsx`)**:\n  * Multi-entry education support (add and delete entries).\n  * Fields: Institution Name, Degree, Branch / Specialisation, Start Year, Graduation Year, and CGPA / Percentage.\n\n* **Section D: Technical Skills (`src/components/studio/SkillsSection.tsx`)**:\n  * Structured under **6 core categories**:\n    1. *Programming Languages*\n    2. *Frameworks & Libraries*\n    3. *Databases & Message Brokers*\n    4. *Developer Tools & Cloud*\n    5. *Core Computer Science Subjects*\n    6. *Other Skills & Competencies*\n  * Interactive tag chips with quick addition and deletion.\n  * **Gemini AI Integration**: *\"Recommend Relevant Keywords\"* analyzes the Target Job Role and suggests standard expected industry tools/skills with 1-click addition.\n\n* **Section E: Projects (`src/components/studio/ProjectsSection.tsx`)**:\n  * Multi-entry project cards.\n  * Fields: Project Name, Project Description, Technologies Used, Project Link, Key Contributions, and Project Outcome (only if supplied by user).\n  * **Gemini AI Integration**: *\"Improve Clarity with AI\"* button rewrites key technical contributions for active verb strength and ATS readability.\n\n* **Section F: Experience (`src/components/studio/ExperienceSection.tsx`)**:\n  * Multi-entry work history cards.\n  * Fields: Organisation, Job Title, Start Date, End Date (with \"Currently working in this position\" toggle), Responsibilities, and Key Achievements.\n  * **Gemini AI Integration**: *\"Rewrite Bullets Professionally\"* formats responsibilities into concise, high-impact action bullets without hallucinating companies or facts.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. Live ATS Resume Document Preview (`src/components/studio/ResumeDocumentPreview.tsx`)\n* **Real-Time Single-Column ATS Layout**:\n  * Clean typographic hierarchy with standard ATS section headings (`Professional Summary`, `Technical Skills`, `Work Experience`, `Technical Projects`, `Education`).\n  * Hairline dividers, balanced measure, and responsive desktop sticky placement.\n* **Actions**:\n  * **Save to My Resumes**: Saves the newly drafted resume directly into the candidate\'s repository in `resumeService`, immediately appearing in the **My Resumes** history interface.\n  * **Print / PDF**: Clean printable styles and simulated high-fidelity PDF and Word DOCX exports.\n\n---\n\n#### 4. Backend & AI Integration (`server.ts` & `src/services/geminiService.ts`)\n* **Server-Side Gemini AI Endpoints** (`server.ts`):\n  * `POST /api/gemini/generate-summary`\n  * `POST /api/gemini/rewrite-bullets`\n  * `POST /api/gemini/recommend-skills`\n  * Enforces `gemini-3.8-flash` with system instructions prohibiting hallucinated qualifications.\n* **Client-Side AI Service** (`src/services/geminiService.ts`):\n  * Issues requests to the server endpoints.\n  * Includes robust deterministic rule-based fallbacks ensuring the interface remains functional and responsive even if offline or if API quotas are exhausted.\n\n---\n\n### How to Test the AI Resume Studio\n\n1. **Access the Studio**:\n   * Sign in via `/login` (click **Quick Demo Login**) or visit `/app`.\n   * Click **AI Resume Studio** (or **Create Resume**) in the left sidebar.\n2. **Test 1-Click Profile**:\n   * Click **Load Sample Profile** in the top toolbar to automatically fill all 6 sections.\n3. **Test Gemini AI Features**:\n   * In **Section B**, click **Generate with Gemini AI** to synthesize an objective summary.\n   * In **Section D**, click **Recommend Relevant Keywords** to view recommended tools for your target role.\n   * In **Section E & F**, click **Improve Clarity with AI** or **Rewrite Bullets Professionally**.\n4. **Live Preview & Repository**:\n   * Watch the document update in real time on the right side.\n   * Click **Save to My Resumes** to store the document in your repository.\n   * Switch to the **My Resumes** tab in the sidebar to verify it is listed in your resume history.\n   * Switch to the **Improve Existing Resume** tab at the top of the Studio to test loading an existing resume into the workspace."
    modified_response: "The **AI Resume Studio** workspace has been built within the authenticated Resume Architect platform. It adheres to the forest-green and warm off-white design system, reuses the existing sidebar, header, and UI components, and connects to Gemini AI API endpoints with strict zero-hallucination constraints.\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built:\n\n#### 1. Page Header & Dual-Tab Layout (`src/components/studio/ResumeStudioView.tsx`)\n* **Title**: **\"AI Resume Studio\"**\n* **Subtitle**: *\"Build a professional resume that demonstrates your skills and matches your career goals.\"*\n* **Top Navigation Tabs**:\n  1. **Create from Scratch**: The primary creation workspace (fully implemented in this phase).\n  2. **Improve Existing Resume**: Prepared for the upcoming Resume Reviewer integration, allowing candidates to pick any resume from their history and load it into the Studio or run compatibility analysis.\n* **Quick Tools Toolbar**:\n  * **Load Sample Profile**: Instant 1-click loading of a complete senior engineering candidate profile (`Sarah Lindqvist`) to test all sections, AI features, and live rendering without manual entry.\n  * **Clear Form**: Resets all fields to blank.\n  * **Mobile Editor / Preview Toggle**: Allows mobile and tablet users to toggle between form entry and the live ATS document sheet.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. User Information Form (Sections A through F)\n\n* **Section A: Personal Information (`src/components/studio/PersonalInfoSection.tsx`)**:\n  * Full Name, Email, Phone Number, Location.\n  * LinkedIn URL, GitHub URL, and Portfolio / Personal Website URL.\n\n* **Section B: Career Objective & Summary (`src/components/studio/CareerObjectiveSection.tsx`)**:\n  * Target Job Role & Target Industry / Domain.\n  * Professional Summary textarea.\n  * **Gemini AI Integration**: *\"Generate with Gemini AI\"* button synthesizes a concise, 3-sentence professional summary using **strictly** the user\'s supplied background, skills, and target role