  planner_response {
    response: "The **Existing Resume Reviewer** and the central **AI Resume Score Engine** have been implemented for **Resume Architect**, adhering to the established design system (warm off-white `#FAF8F5`, forest green `#1B4332`, charcoal typography `#1C201D`).\n\n### Key Capabilities Built\n\n1. **Flexible Candidate Resume Input Modes**\n   - **Select from Saved Resumes**: Instant one-click selection from the candidate\'s existing repository (`My Resumes`), displaying version tags, format badges, and past match ratings.\n   - **Interactive File Upload (PDF / DOCX / TXT)**: Drag-and-drop zone with semantic ATS text layer extraction, file size indicators, and a one-click sample loader (*Marcus Vance Staff Systems Dossier*).\n   - **Raw Text Paste**: Monospace editor with live word and character counters.\n\n2. **Target Job Description & Mandate Ingestion**\n   - **Paste Mandate**: Fields for Target Job Title, Target Organization, and the complete job description text.\n   - **Job URL Fetcher**: Input field with automated mandate extraction from employer links (Greenhouse, Lever, etc.).\n   - **4 Pre-Calibrated Enterprise Role Presets**:\n     - *Staff Distributed Systems Engineer (Cloudflare / Edge)*\n     - *Lead Full-Stack Product Engineer (Stripe / Payments)*\n     - *Senior Cloud & Platform Architect (Enterprise Cloud)*\n     - *AI/ML Systems Platform Engineer (Scale AI / LLM Serving)*\n\n3. **Deterministic AI Resume Score Engine (`/api/score-engine/analyze`)**\n   - Transparent, non-arbitrary scoring calculated via the weighted arithmetic mean formula:\n     $$\\text{Overall Score} = (0.25 \\times \\text{Keyword}) + (0.25 \\times \\text{Skills}) + (0.20 \\times \\text{Experience}) + (0.15 \\times \\text{Projects}) + (0.10 \\times \\text{Formatting}) + (0.05 \\times \\text{Education})$$\n   - Real-time Gemini AI integration with zero-hallucination constraints, plus deterministic fallback for offline resilience.\n   - Score grade indicators (*Exceptional*, *Strong*, *Competitive*, *Needs Revision*).\n\n4. **Multi-Faceted Analysis Workspace**\n   - **6-Pillar Category Breakdown**: Dynamic visual progress meters, weights, matched-versus-total counts, and analytical summaries.\n   - **Missing Target Keywords**: Categorized by importance (*Critical Mandate*, *Important*, *Beneficial*) with employer frequency counts and one-click copy.\n   - **Skill Gap Analysis**: Direct side-by-side comparison of *Job Mandate Requirement* vs. *Candidate Evidence in Resume* with architect recommendations.\n   - **Actionable Bullet Rewrites**: Prioritized high-impact improvements with estimated score delta gains ($+6$, $+5$, $+4$ points) and side-by-side **Before (Generic)** vs. **After (Architect Recommended Rewrite)** comparisons.\n\n5. **Integrated Workflow Actions**\n   - **Open & Refine in AI Resume Studio**: Seamlessly transitions the analyzed resume and recommendations into the Studio workspace for live editing and ATS formatting.\n   - **Export Report**: Print and export-ready compatibility audit report.\n   - Accessible via the sidebar navigation (`Review Resume`), the Tools Dashboard overview, and from any saved resume in `My Resumes`."
    modified_response: "The **Existing Resume Reviewer** and the central **AI Resume Score Engine** have been implemented for **Resume Architect**, adhering to the established design system (warm off-white `#FAF8F5`, forest green `#1B4332`, charcoal typography `#1C201D`).\n\n### Key Capabilities Built\n\n1. **Flexible Candidate Resume Input Modes**\n   - **Select from Saved Resumes**: Instant one-click selection from the candidate\'s existing repository (`My Resumes`), displaying version tags, format badges, and past match ratings.\n   - **Interactive File Upload (PDF / DOCX / TXT)**: Drag-and-drop zone with semantic ATS text layer extraction, file size indicators, and a one-click sample loader (*Marcus Vance Staff Systems Dossier*).\n   - **Raw Text Paste**: Monospace editor with live word and character counters.\n\n2. **Target Job Description & Mandate Ingestion**\n   - **Paste Mandate**: Fields for Target Job Title, Target Organization, and the complete job description text.\n   - **Job URL Fetcher**: Input field with automated mandate extraction from employer links (Greenhouse, Lever, etc.).\n   - **4 Pre-Calibrated Enterprise Role Presets**:\n     - *Staff Distributed Systems Engineer (Cloudflare / Edge)*\n     - *Lead Full-Stack Product Engineer (Stripe / Payments)*\n     - *Senior Cloud & Platform Architect (Enterprise Cloud)*\n     - *AI/ML Systems Platform Engineer (Scale AI / LLM Serving)*\n\n3. **Deterministic AI Resume Score Engine (`/api/score-engine/analyze`)**\n   - Transparent, non-arbitrary scoring calculated via the weighted arithmetic mean formula:\n     $$\\text{Overall Score} = (0.25 \\times \\text{Keyword}) + (0.25 \\times \\text{Skills}) + (0.20 \\times \\text{Experience}) + (0.15 \\times \\text{Projects}) + (0.10 \\times \\text{Formatting}) + (0.05 \\times \\text{Education})$$\n   - Real-time Gemini AI integration with zero-hallucination constraints, plus deterministic fallback for offline resilience.\n   - Score grade indicators (*Exceptional*, *Strong*, *Competitive*, *Needs Revision*).\n\n4. **Multi-Faceted Analysis Workspace**\n   - **6-Pillar Category Breakdown**: Dynamic visual progress meters, weights, matched-versus-total counts, and analytical summaries.\n   - **Missing Target Keywords**: Categorized by importance (*Critical Mandate*, *Important*, *Beneficial*) with employer frequency counts and one-click copy.\n   - **Skill Gap Analysis**: Direct side-by-side comparison of *Job Mandate Requirement* vs. *Candidate Evidence in Resume* with architect recommendations.\n   - **Actionable Bullet Rewrites**: Prioritized high-impact improvements with estimated score delta gains ($+6$, $+5$, $+4$ points) and side-by-side **Before (Generic)** vs. **After (Architect Recommended Rewrite)** comparisons.\n\n5. **Integrated Workflow Actions**\n   - **Open & Refine in AI Resume Studio**: Seamlessly transitions the analyzed resume and recommendations into the Studio workspace for live editing and ATS formatting.\n   - **Export Report**: Print and export-ready compatibility audit report.\n   - Accessible via the sidebar navigation (`Review Resume`), the Tools Dashboard overview, and from any saved resume in `My Resumes`."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\340\001\n\335\001\001i\024}\023\217\a\365\027S~\346\372\223\310\253\232\247\350O\255\344\362\024\347E\310m\242\217{\232\006_\260y\322p\222\022\376V\033\221A\241\302\247\022\256v\"6L\034\245nm\"\211\335\032%\214\026\371/\276\211\226jL\243\246\360\345x\303C\237\375\304,\364\037\242{:\020\2373\255\245\353\265\264\"\277n\006r\251\300\a\021\364i\226PW\023\374\b\271|\365?\252\034\001\253\205\201\340\235\356t\373?\034\243\312\265\344b(t\332T\302\t\344 \211\302\034\332\232J\262\370\037\001\214$~PvkJc\215\260_}Y\252\376@\326\252\032\033\261\311\252\020\\<\357\340\203\226\224o\024[\a\276K\024{\022kU\023\320\025\212\213L1\222\243\202\361a\031@\025Jl\272\027\354f\275sG\b\006"
