  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Existing Functionality**\n\nI\'m currently reviewing `ResumeReviewerView.tsx` to identify its existing features and cross-reference them with user requests 6 and 7. The goal is to understand the current implementation and how it aligns with building the AI Resume Score Engine, which is a key feature of Resume Architect.\n\n\n**Defining Core Features**\n\nI am now focusing on the fundamental features required for the resume analysis system. My primary considerations involve how the user can upload a resume and provide a job description. I also must evaluate how to calculate a match score, categorize it, and identify missing keywords and skill gaps. I\'m thinking how to provide actionable recommendations, including before/after rewrites and estimated score gains.\n\n\n"
