  planner_response {
    response: "### Resume Architect \342\200\224 AI Resume Score Engine & Existing Resume Reviewer\n\nThe **Existing Resume Reviewer** and central **AI Resume Score Engine** have been fully developed and integrated into Resume Architect, maintaining the forest green (`#1B4332`), warm off-white (`#FAF8F5`), and charcoal typography design system.\n\n---\n\n### Core Systems & Features Implemented\n\n#### 1. Central AI Resume Score Engine\n* **Deterministic 6-Pillar Weighted Formula**:\n  * **Keyword Alignment (25%)**: Real-time frequency density analysis comparing job postings to resume tokens.\n  * **Technical Skills (25%)**: Exact and contextual matches for programming languages, cloud systems, and frameworks.\n  * **Experience Relevance (20%)**: Seniority level, measurable impact verbs, and domain alignment.\n  * **Project Relevance (15%)**: Portfolio artifacts, production deployments, and applied technology relevance.\n  * **Formatting & Readability (10%)**: Standard ATS semantic parsing, linear reading flow, and bullet-point structure.\n  * **Education Relevance (5%)**: Degree and field of study verification.\n* **Server-Side Engine (`/api/score-engine/analyze`)**:\n  * Powered by Gemini AI with anti-hallucination guardrails and structured evaluation output.\n  * Built-in multi-factor fallback ensuring scoring and keyword token extraction operate even without external API connectivity.\n\n#### 2. Flexible Resume & Job Inputs\n* **Resume Sources**:\n  * **Saved Repository**: One-click selection from the user\'s existing saved resumes with version tracking.\n  * **Upload File**: Drag-and-drop or file browser supporting PDF, DOCX, and TXT files up to 10 MB.\n  * **Raw Text**: Text editor for pasting custom profiles, with a one-click **\"Load Sample Staff Resume\"** benchmark.\n* **Target Job Mandate**:\n  * **Paste Mandate**: Custom text area for job descriptions and responsibilities.\n  * **Job URL**: Automated requirement extraction from employer job links (e.g. Greenhouse, Lever).\n  * **Role Presets**: 4 pre-calibrated enterprise mandates (*Staff Distributed Systems Engineer*, *Senior Full-Stack Engineer*, *Lead Cloud Architect*, *Machine Learning Platform Engineer*).\n\n#### 3. Interactive Reviewer Dashboard\n* **Score Hero Display**: Circular score indicator (0\342\200\223100), performance grade (*Exceptional*, *Strong*, *Competitive*, *Needs Revision*), and formula breakdown.\n* **6-Pillar Category Breakdown**: Individual scores, weights, status badges (*Optimal*, *Moderate*, *Action Required*), and metric counters.\n* **Missing Keywords Matrix**: High-signal keywords categorized into *Critical Mandate*, *Technical Tool*, and *Industry Practice* with job frequency counters and one-click copy to clipboard.\n* **Skill Gap Analysis**: Side-by-side comparison of employer requirements vs. candidate evidence in resume, with specific bridge recommendations.\n* **Actionable Rewrites with Live Score Recalculation**:\n  * Side-by-side **Before** (generic/weak phrasing) vs. **Architect Recommended Rewrite** (quantified achievement).\n  * One-click **\"Apply Rewrite\"**: Dynamically adds points (+3 to +5) to the live compatibility score and reflects active application.\n* **ATS Heatmap & Diff View**: Visual inspection highlighting matched keywords in emerald, weak action verbs in amber, and ATS section headers.\n* **Enterprise ATS Parser Simulator**: Real-time parsing simulation for **Workday**, **Greenhouse**, **Taleo**, and **Lever**, testing contact data extraction, column layout, and section hierarchies.\n* **Executive Compatibility Audit Export**: Printable modal with clean print styling for exporting executive compatibility reports."
    modified_response: "### Resume Architect \342\200\224 AI Resume Score Engine & Existing Resume Reviewer\n\nThe **Existing Resume Reviewer** and central **AI Resume Score Engine** have been fully developed and integrated into Resume Architect, maintaining the forest green (`#1B4332`), warm off-white (`#FAF8F5`), and charcoal typography design system.\n\n---\n\n### Core Systems & Features Implemented\n\n#### 1. Central AI Resume Score Engine\n* **Deterministic 6-Pillar Weighted Formula**:\n  * **Keyword Alignment (25%)**: Real-time frequency density analysis comparing job postings to resume tokens.\n  * **Technical Skills (25%)**: Exact and contextual matches for programming languages, cloud systems, and frameworks.\n  * **Experience Relevance (20%)**: Seniority level, measurable impact verbs, and domain alignment.\n  * **Project Relevance (15%)**: Portfolio artifacts, production deployments, and applied technology relevance.\n  * **Formatting & Readability (10%)**: Standard ATS semantic parsing, linear reading flow, and bullet-point structure.\n  * **Education Relevance (5%)**: Degree and field of study verification.\n* **Server-Side Engine (`/api/score-engine/analyze`)**:\n  * Powered by Gemini AI with anti-hallucination guardrails and structured evaluation output.\n  * Built-in multi-factor fallback ensuring scoring and keyword token extraction operate even without external API connectivity.\n\n#### 2. Flexible Resume & Job Inputs\n* **Resume Sources**:\n  * **Saved Repository**: One-click selection from the user\'s existing saved resumes with version tracking.\n  * **Upload File**: Drag-and-drop or file browser supporting PDF, DOCX, and TXT files up to 10 MB.\n  * **Raw Text**: Text editor for pasting custom profiles, with a one-click **\"Load Sample Staff Resume\"** benchmark.\n* **Target Job Mandate**:\n  * **Paste Mandate**: Custom text area for job descriptions and responsibilities.\n  * **Job URL**: Automated requirement extraction from employer job links (e.g. Greenhouse, Lever).\n  * **Role Presets**: 4 pre-calibrated enterprise mandates (*Staff Distributed Systems Engineer*, *Senior Full-Stack Engineer*, *Lead Cloud Architect*, *Machine Learning Platform Engineer*).\n\n#### 3. Interactive Reviewer Dashboard\n* **Score Hero Display**: Circular score indicator (0\342\200\223100), performance grade (*Exceptional*, *Strong*, *Competitive*, *Needs Revision*), and formula breakdown.\n* **6-Pillar Category Breakdown**: Individual scores, weights, status badges (*Optimal*, *Moderate*, *Action Required*), and metric counters.\n* **Missing Keywords Matrix**: High-signal keywords categorized into *Critical Mandate*, *Technical Tool*, and *Industry Practice* with job frequency counters and one-click copy to clipboard.\n* **Skill Gap Analysis**: Side-by-side comparison of employer requirements vs. candidate evidence in resume, with specific bridge recommendations.\n* **Actionable Rewrites with Live Score Recalculation**:\n  * Side-by-side **Before** (generic/weak phrasing) vs. **Architect Recommended Rewrite** (quantified achievement).\n  * One-click **\"Apply Rewrite\"**: Dynamically adds points (+3 to +5) to the live compatibility score and reflects active application.\n* **ATS Heatmap & Diff View**: Visual inspection highlighting matched keywords in emerald, weak action verbs in amber, and ATS section headers.\n* **Enterprise ATS Parser Simulator**: Real-time parsing simulation for **Workday**, **Greenhouse**, **Taleo**, and **Lever**, testing contact data extraction, column layout, and section hierarchies.\n* **Executive Compatibility Audit Export**: Printable modal with clean print styling for exporting executive compatibility reports."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\365\002\n\362\002\001i\024}\023\335\344\231\346\356\264\227V\324L\313\314=\343\352\202AJ\356\r\343%l.%\334m\"\226\353\372\336\352\t\264\345\337L \275\365\2615 \254\273zv?\247\251\352F\254\377\004\320k\350@\366z\357SnYX\271\373\343\303\277\254\233|+a\231\367\245\006\3032?\365\"\323\240\334\351\003wR\v9\016\366M\262\247\317\247\024.\366\245\314d\b\037<3\327\022\207\352\300m,\313\230:D\256[]\367\212\301|P6u\236\361(O\232\233uJ\223H*G\320g\215!eMi\277`\025\273\376\\\201\247C\360\334`\177\213_\276\335\317\372\207f\030\355\204\002\262\022\3318\317\233\271\365.\357\261P}0VAf.\235E\234\037\"\n8)Z\307\317@`\274\275\351\314\301\355\320\335\312\314\307\363\363?X)v<\376\342F\321QtKPI\302@0Z\373\230\220\261\356\305AH\226<\325\237\321\035\320\300\235\271k\aa$\206\311\267\3508\313t\372F\a\310O\374\231\365\234\030/=6\035\374\243ZM<\270\203k\v\356\323Z\247#w\215\r\322\033]j\351\326(\300\373\216\362\353\276\017E\200\223\005&\226\210\\\363j\256\225\220\275\332\004\205;\230H\245L\217\311a\337#\266\277=\270\177c\222F\211g\376V\304\201\331k\227\'\320\344V\006\215\"\277"
