      text: "Continue developing the existing Resume Architect project.\n\nDo not create a new project or redesign existing pages.\n\nMaintain the established:\n\n* Forest green and warm off-white design.\n* Typography.\n* Sidebar.\n* Navigation.\n* Component styling.\n\nBuild the Existing Resume Reviewer and the central AI Resume Score Engine.\n\nThis is one of the most important features of Resume Architect.\n\n==================================================\n\n1. OBJECTIVE\n   ==================================================\n\nCreate a resume analysis system that evaluates how well a candidate\'s existing resume matches a specific job description.\n\nThe user should be able to:\n\n1. Upload an existing resume.\n2. Paste a job description or provide a job description URL.\n3. Analyse the resume.\n4. Receive a match score out of 100.\n5. Understand the score category by category.\n6. Ident"
