    thinking: "**Analyzing the Request**\n\nI\'m focused on the constraints: no new project, no redesign, maintain the color scheme. This clarifies the \"what\" and the \"how\". The key is in continuing development while remaining true to the existing foundation. I need to be careful to implement any new functionality. It can\'t break existing functionality. It can\'t have conflicting design choices. I must make sure it doesn\'t deviate from the existing functionality and design.\n\n\n**Defining the Scope**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the LinkedIn Profile Optimizer. The objective is clear: an AI-powered tool for profile enhancement, using authentic data. Page design includes input fields on the left and analysis/preview on the right. I\'ve broken down profile input into manual entry or resume import, with 7 quality dimensions in mind.\n\n\n"
