            }
            lines {
              text: "        text: `Recent ${education[0]?.degree || \'Computer Science\'} graduate from ${education[0]?.institution || \'University\'} with hands-on project experience in ${primarySkills}.\\n\\nI am driven by a passion for solving real-world challenges through well-crafted code. Through academic projects and practical development, I have built practical applications and worked extensively with modern version control, automated testing, and agile team workflows.\\n\\nEager to contribute as an entry-level ${targetRole} and learn from experienced engineering teams.`,"
