    captured_user_requests {
      text: "Continue developing the existing Resume Architect project.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\n* Do not create a new project.\n* Do not redesign existing pages.\n* Maintain the existing forest-green and warm off-white design system.\n* Reuse the existing sidebar, navbar, buttons and components.\n* Build only the AI Resume Studio in this phase.\n\n==================================================\n\n1. OBJECTIVE\n   ==================================================\n\nBuild an AI-powered resume creation workspace.\n\nUsers should be able to create a professional resume from scratch by entering their actual information.\n\nThe system should use Gemini AI to:\n\n* Organise resume information.\n* Improve sentence clarity.\n* Rewrite bullet points professionally.\n* Recommend relevant keywords.\n* Generate a professional summary.\n* Structure the resume for ATS-conscious formatting.\n\nThe system must never invent qualifications, skills, projects, employment history or achievements.\n\n==================================================\n2. PAGE LAYOUT\n==============\n\nCreate a clean, professional page titled:\n\n\"AI Resume Studio\"\n\nSubtitle:\n\n\"Build a professional resume that demonstrates your skills and matches your career goals.\"\n\nAt the top, include two tabs:\n\n1. Create from Scratch\n2. Improve Existing Resume\n\nFor this development phase, implement Create from Scratch fully.\n\nThe Improve Existing Resume tab should be prepared for the upcoming Resume Reviewer integration.\n\n==================================================\n3. USER INFORMATION FORM\n========================\n\nCreate a structured form divided into sections.\n\nSECTION A: PERSONAL INFORMATION\n\nFields:\n\n* Full Name.\n* Email.\n* Phone Number.\n* Location.\n* LinkedIn URL.\n* GitHub URL.\n* Portfolio URL.\n\nSECTION B: CAREER OBJECTIVE\n\nFields:\n\n* Target Job Role.\n* Target Industry.\n* Professional Summary (optional).\n\nAllow Gemini AI to generate a professional summary using only the information supplied by the user.\n\nSECTION C: EDUCATION\n\nAllow users to add multiple education entries.\n\nFields:\n\n* Institution Name.\n* Degree.\n* Branch / Specialisation.\n* Start Year.\n* Graduation Year.\n* CGPA / Percentage.\n\nSECTION D: TECHNICAL SKILLS\n\nAllow users to add skills under categories:\n\n* Programming Languages.\n* Frameworks.\n* Databases.\n* Developer Tools.\n* Core Computer Science Subjects.\n* Other Skills.\n\nAllow users to add and remove skills.\n\nSECTION E: PROJECTS\n\nAllow multiple project entries.\n\nFields:\n\n* Project Name.\n* Project Description.\n* Technologies Used.\n* Project Link.\n* Key Contributions.\n* Project Outcome (only if supplied by the user).\n\nSECTION F: EXPERIENCE\n\nAllow users to add multiple experience entries.\n\nFields:\n\n* Organisation.\n* Job Title.\n* Start Date.\n* End Date.\n* Responsibilities.\n* Ac"
