  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Installing Python Dependencies**\n\nI\'m currently focused on installing the Python dependencies. I\'ve added `google-genai` to the list. Simultaneously, I\'m working on crafting the clean and robust Python modules. The initial modules, as requested by Prompt 9, are: `backend/app/core/config.py` and `backend/app/core/security.py`. I aim to ensure these are well-structured.\n\n\n**Defining Module Structure**\n\nI\'m now deep in defining the remaining Python module structure. I\'m focusing on creating files for database connections, models, various schemas (auth, resume, analysis, linkedin), and key services like Gemini, score engines, evidence mapping, truth guarding, resume parsing and export, along with service modules for resumes and LinkedIn. Also, I\'m working on the API endpoints for auth, resumes, analysis, editor and LinkedIn. Lastly, I\'ll structure the main application file, ensuring all components work in concert.\n\n\n"
