  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Observing API Configuration**\n\nI\'ve just noticed how the base URL for API calls is constructed in `src/services/api.ts`. It\'s using `import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL` or defaulting to `/api/v1`. This is interesting because I remember all our FastAPI endpoints are mounted under `/api`, such as `/api/auth` or `/api/resources`. Now I\'m just curious if we need to reconcile the version path with the mounted path structure.\n\n\n"
